   "source": [
    "The input `gene_membership_df` records gene symbols and names of the matched sets. This cell intersects that table with the **full DoRothEA graph**. Selection is sorted lexicographically by: (i) more matching sets, (ii) higher regulatory degree, (iii) alphabetical gene symbol. `SEED_TOP_N=25` keeps 25 **anchors**, not a 25-gene optimized Boolean network. Neighbors and bridge genes can later join the candidate domain even if they did not match any MSigDB name.\n"
   ]
