   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "49cac047",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Select hematopoiesis seeds present in DoRothEA\n",
    "\n",
    "Gene-set membership is *not* a guarantee that a gene causally regulates hematopoiesis. Here, it is used only for **candidate prioritization**. The number of overlapping sets is not independent experimental evidence (many collections reuse the same annotations). All comparisons use uppercase mouse gene symbols to match the standardized original network.\n",
    "\n",
